# Python standards

- Use Black formatting (line length 88 per pyproject.toml)
- Run mypy on typed modules under brickflow/context, cli, hints, engine, resolver, codegen
- Run prospector via `make check` before finishing
- Use Poetry for dependencies; do not use pip/conda for project deps
- Match existing import style and module layout
- Prefer extending existing functions over duplicating logic
